a [ef02314].\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta (ef02314f2) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9636) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.69 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\n**Expected Behaviour**\n\nIn Godot 4.6 and 4.7, if any node(s) is copied and exactly 1 node is selected, both \"Paste\" and \"Paste as Sibling\" are shown in the scene tree context menu upon right-click. \"Paste as Sibling\" is shown as disabled (cannot be pressed) if the selected node is the scene root.\n\n**Unexpected Behaviour**\n\nIn Godot 4.7, the new \"Paste as Replacement\" is shown/hidden inconsistently:\n- When right-clicking a inherited scene root, \"Paste as Replacement\" is hidden (not shown as disabled).\n- When right-clicking a yellow foreign node, \"Paste as Replacement\" is hidden (not shown as disabled).\n- When right-clicking more than one normal node, only \"Paste as Replacement\" is shown (without \"Paste\" and \"Paste as Sibling\").\n\nI can open a PR if needed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Copy \"Node2D\" in `main.tscn`.\n2. Right-click any node(s) to open the scene tree context menu.\n3. Test the edge cases described above.\n\nScreenshots:\n\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"489\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/95e50236-80e8-46f4-a017-e99c9f9c6e05\" />\n\n<img width=\"380\" height=\"488\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d9314e10-99e0-4c2b-9774-ee47f02affbd\" />\n\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35438d24-0263-4c23-b482-21f401a11a50\" />\n\n<img width=\"379\" height=\"489\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c69d4a7c-db8d-4f44-8ba6-318a3ee846b0\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP_Inconsistent_Paste.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28162868/MRP_Inconsistent_Paste.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119674/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119674/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}